    <string name="about_title">ABOUT</string>
    <string name="about_body">Paradox Gaming Tools 1.0.0\nby Jahid Hasan\n\nEverything runs on this device. The app has no INTERNET permission, no ads and no analytics.\n\nHonest limits: Android does not allow a normal app to force-kill other apps or change CPU and GPU clocks. A boost here means trimming background processes, dropping caches and muting interruptions. Real overclocking needs root.</string>
    <string name="adb_title">EXTRA: SMOOTHER ANIMATIONS</string>
    <string name="adb_body">With USB debugging on, run this once from a PC to cut transition animations system wide:\n\nadb shell settings put global window_animation_scale 0\nadb shell settings put global transition_animation_scale 0\nadb shell settings put global animator_duration_scale 0</string>
